  },
  "content": {
    "title": "Trust Framework — API Resources",
    "intro": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The API resources hosted on an LFI's Authorisation Server represent the key resources that are exposed through various endpoints."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "The format of these endpoints is:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "items": [
          "Production: https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/[APIFamily]/[Version]/[Endpoint]",
          "Sandbox: https://rs1.[LFICode].sandbox.apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/[APIFamily]/[Version]/[Endpoint]"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "These endpoints are organized into structured categories known as API families. Each API family groups together related functionality, making it easier for TPPs to understand the available services."
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "payment",
        "level": 2,
        "anchor": "payment",
        "category": "API Family",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "This family includes endpoints related to initiating and managing payments."
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "These endpoints are part of the Bank Service Initiation functionality and associated with the BSIP role.",
              "Allowed API scopes: openid payments"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "subsections": [
          {
            "heading": "Consent Endpoints",
            "level": 3,
            "anchor": null,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "These endpoints are used to create and manage payment consents."
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "Supported grant type: client_credentials"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Example endpoints:"
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/payment/[Version]/payment-consents",
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/payment/[Version]/payment-consents/{ConsentId}"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "heading": "Resource Endpoints",
            "level": 3,
            "anchor": null,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "These endpoints are used to initiate and retrieve payments, including file-based payments."
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "Supported grant types: authorization_code, refresh_token"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Example endpoints:"
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/payment/[Version]/payments",
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/payment/[Version]/payments/{PaymentId}",
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/payment/[Version]/file-payments"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "account-information",
        "level": 2,
        "anchor": "account-information",
        "category": "API Family",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "This family includes endpoints related to retrieving bank data e.g. accounts, balances, transactions, etc."
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "These endpoints are part of the Bank Data Sharing functionality and are associated with the BDSP role.",
              "Allowed API scopes: openid accounts",
              "Supported grant types: authorization_code, refresh_token"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "subsections": [
          {
            "heading": "Consent Endpoints",
            "level": 3,
            "anchor": null,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "These endpoints are used to create and manage account information consents."
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "Supported grant type: client_credentials"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Example endpoints:"
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/account-information/[Version]/account-access-consents",
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/account-information/[Version]/account-access-consents/{ConsentId}"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "heading": "Resource Endpoints",
            "level": 3,
            "anchor": null,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "These endpoints are used to retrieve account information."
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "Supported grant types: authorization_code, refresh_token"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "text": "Example endpoints:"
              },
              {
                "type": "list",
                "items": [
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/account-information/[Version]/accounts",
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/account-information/[Version]/accounts/{AccountId}/balances",
                  "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/account-information/[Version]/accounts/{AccountId}/transactions"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "heading": "confirmation",
        "level": 2,
        "anchor": "confirmation",
        "category": "API Family",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "This family includes endpoints related to the discovery and confirmation of bank account details, such as verifying account ownership before initiating payments."
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "These endpoints are part of the Confirmation of Payee functionality and are associated with the BSIP role.",
              "Allowed API scopes: openid payments",
              "Supported grant types: client_credentials"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Resource Endpoint examples:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/confirmation-of-payee/[Version]/confirmation",
              "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/confirmation-of-payee/[Version]/discovery"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "subsections": []
      },
      {
        "heading": "product",
        "level": 2,
        "anchor": "product",
        "category": "API Family",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "This family includes endpoints related to the discovery of banking products and posting a user who is interested in applying for a banking product."
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "Associated with the BDSP role.",
              "Allowed API scopes: openid accounts",
              "Supported grant types: client_credentials"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Resource Endpoint examples:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/product/[Version]/products",
              "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/product/[Version]/leads"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "subsections": []
      },
      {
        "heading": "atm",
        "level": 2,
        "anchor": "atm",
        "category": "API Family",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "This family includes endpoints related to the discovery of an LFI's ATM network — locations, services, and accessibility data."
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "These endpoints are part of the ATMs functionality and are associated with the BDSP role.",
              "Allowed API scopes: atm",
              "Supported grant types: client_credentials"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Resource Endpoint examples:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "items": [
              "https://rs1.[LFICode].apihub.openfinance.ae/open-finance/atm/[Version]/atms"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "subsections": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
